<title>INDIA: India Essar Oil 96/97 1ST half net down.</title>
<headline>India Essar Oil 96/97 1ST half net down.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	135.9    vs	239.9</p>
<p>    Gross income  1,294.4    vs    1,299.1</p>
<p>    Expenditure     997.5    vs	917.3</p>
<p>    Interest	   64.6    vs	 68.3</p>
<p>    Depreciation     96.4    vs	 73.6</p>
<p>    Tax		   Nil    vs	 Nil</p>
<p>Note: Essar Oil, belonging to the private Essar group, is an oil services firm now building a refinery on the western coast.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91-22-265 9000)</p>
</text>
